"""Street Legends frontend: Card Table house item - Spades + Gin Rummy PvC,
PLAYER VS PLAYER rooms + PvP games, MOVE / SELL ($10,000 back).
Run from repo root: python3 frontend/patch-house-cardtable-frontend.py
Idempotent - safe to re-run.
Same proven pattern as pool + darts, with one fix baked in: the menu render
line is written WITH onPlayPvp in the first place, so no later wiring patch
(and no global "already wired" check) is needed.
FRONTEND ONLY - reload Expo Go to check. Rooms work once the backend card
rooms endpoints are live; if the backend is not live yet, the rooms screen
says so instead of crashing.
"""
